  "description": {
    "text": "The Pikachu deck from the DPt Gift Box, released on 20 November 2008: four ready-built 30-card half decks, led by Chimchar, Turtwig, Piplup and Pikachu and set at different levels of difficulty, with four holo cards between them. The box also held a practice playmat, acrylic damage counters, paper markers and a case for them, a Pokémon coin die to throw in place of a coin, a how-to-play book and a sticker sheet, so it could be played the day it was opened.",
